{"title":"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If February is a month that contains Friday the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/6/3364712739329cd5cae9cc91abbb5c358e0e5788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13^{\\text{th}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"30\" height=\"16\" />, what day of the week is February 1?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/2/23211fd04cbab3cc3fa339e7821d0ec4be0af544.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{Sunday} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{Monday} \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{Wednesday} \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{Thursday}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{Saturday}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"631\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can go backwards by days, but we can also backwards by weeks. If we go backwards by weeks, we see that February 6 is a Friday. If we now go backwards by days, February 1 is a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/1/c0147fa9f21c348749f51b9fff8cbbd46aaaea20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{Sunday}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"100\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the days of the week repeat every 7 days and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/e/5ae6bb4ef1ed9edfdb8744480dc674b4a9266537.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1-13\\equiv2\\pmod7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"153\" height=\"18\" />, the day of the week of the day 2 days after February 13 is the same as the day of the week of February 1. Since we know that February 13 is a Friday, the day of the week of the day 2 days after February 13 is a Sunday so we get that February 1 is a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/1/c0147fa9f21c348749f51b9fff8cbbd46aaaea20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{Sunday}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"100\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can go back 2 weeks and say that Friday is the -1st of February. Going forward 2 days, we get that February 1st is Sunday. So our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/1/c0147fa9f21c348749f51b9fff8cbbd46aaaea20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{Sunday}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"100\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8\" title=\"2008 AMC 8\">2008 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2008\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2008 AMC 